            "id": "https://phileasdg.github.io/sympoietic/manifesto.html",
            "url": "https://phileasdg.github.io/sympoietic/manifesto.html",
            "title": "Manifesto",
            "summary": "The goal of this project is to grow a sympoietic art organism. To cultivate an art ecosystem by drawing from&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The goal of this project is to grow a </span><strong>sympoietic art organism</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. To cultivate an art ecosystem by drawing from and enriching shared artistic commons. To showcase art that mixes media and visions, that brings out the analog from digital, and digitizes the analog.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By </span><strong>sympoietic art organism</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we mean an artwork (or more precisely, an ongoing artistic process) that is poetic, conceptual, and ecological in nature. It is:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Co-created (not made by a single author),</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open-ended and adaptive (always becoming),</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Responsive to its environment (not closed off from change),</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Distributed in agency (not centered on human control), and</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Relational (interdependent with other systems, beings, or forces).</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The word “sympoietic” comes from sympoiesis, coined by systems theorists and developed by Donna Haraway, meaning “making-with” rather than autopoiesis, which is self-making. Sympoiesis is collective, dynamic, and contingent.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The following manifesto </span>is<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> assembled from contributions from each founding member of the sympoietic art collective. It will be its own record of our meta-artistic intent, and art object. It will be available as part of the artistic commons we are growing.</span></p>\n<h2>[Organic Autocatalytic Disruptive Collective Anarchist Magical Quilting]:</h2>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A manifesto for the co-creation of a sympoietic art organism.</span></em></p>\n<p> </p>",
